== Registers of the ''mico32_camera'' ==

Following registers are visible by the program:

{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Register Name
! Offset
! Num. Bits
! Type
|-
| ADDR
| 0x0
| 32
| R/W
|-
| STATE
| 0x04
| 32
| R
|-
| FLAG
| 0x08
| 32
| R
|-
| CNTR1
| 0x0C
| 32
